,0.020181553,0.0036075406,0.011866961,0.008698216,-0.007300945,0.006258565,0.0064099827,-0.009438597,0.00255339,0.016596796,-0.006864764,-0.021956457,-0.02694512,-0.011596892,-0.008899908,0.0037707994,0.002534418,-0.014155799,-0.01123087,-0.0035991443,-0.0019563749,0.014879082,0.0073726955,0.01172726,0.0032228993,0.019811306,-0.011375028,0.0002317693,0.014732157,0.0054593254,-0.0037042866,0.013264212,-0.015448307,0.0063455543,-0.014144753,0.009275421,0.012137096,0.007908775,0.0014144641,0.004791373,-0.0029722226,-0.024647277,-0.112964235,-0.0031514335,-0.041991536,0.010965392,0.0039782845,0.01652503,0.0018769571,-0.020319128,-0.008659843,0.004901102]'),
(66,'Apple\'s Siri Overhauled with \'Siri AI\': First Impressions','apples-siri-overhauled-with-siri-ai-first-impressions-2F1NrM','Apple has announced a major update to its voice assistant, now called Siri AI. This new version, shown as part of the upcoming iOS 27, is designed to be more conversational and understand user requests better, marking Apple\'s entry into advanced AI assistants.\n<img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572686163547-e326c585bcc7?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w4OTkzMzh8MHwxfHJhbmRvbXx8fHx8fHx8fDE3ODE5Nzk0NTd8&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080\" alt=\"A phone screen showing the new Siri AI interface with a colorful wave pattern\">\n<ul>\n<li><b>More natural conversation</b> allows the assistant to handle back-and-forth chats. You can ask a follow-up question, and Siri AI will remember the context of the previous interaction without needing you to repeat information.</li>\n<li><b>On-screen awareness</b> means Siri AI can now understand what is on your screen. You can ask it to summarize an article you are reading or add a product from a webpage to your shopping list just by speaking.</li>\n<li><b>Personal context</b> is used to improve answers. The system learns your habits, important contacts, and routines to provide more relevant suggestions, such as knowing which \'Mom\' to call if you have two in your contacts.</li>\n<li><b>Better app integration</b> lets Siri AI perform complex, multi-step tasks within and across different applications. For example, you can tell it to find a photo from last month, edit it, and then send it to a friend in a message.</li>\n<li><b>A focus on privacy</b> ensures most of this new processing happens directly on your device. Apple states that for most common requests, your personal information is not sent to the cloud, protecting your data.</li>\n</ul>\nThe new Siri AI is Apple\'s direct response to other advanced AI systems and is a central feature of the iOS 27 software update. The update is expected to be available for all compatible devices this fall.',NULL,'published',1,0,'en','{\"es\":{\"title\":\"Apple redise\\u00f1a su asistente de voz \'Siri AI\': Primera impresi\\u00f3n\",\"summary\":\"Apple oficialmente se ha unido a la carrera del IA avanzada al redise\\u00f1ar su asistente de voz, ahora llamado \'Siri AI\', como parte de la pr\\u00f3xima actualizaci\\u00f3n de iOS 27. Esta nueva versi\\u00f3n promete una experiencia m\\u00e1s natural y conversacional, permitiendo a Siri AI entender contextos y manejar intercambios complejos sin necesidad de repetir informaci\\u00f3n.\",\"content\":\"<p>Apple ha anunciado una actualizaci\\u00f3n importante a su asistente de voz, ahora llamado <b>Siri AI<\\/b>. Esta nueva versi\\u00f3n, mostrada como parte de la pr\\u00f3xima versi\\u00f3n de iOS 27, est\\u00e1 dise\\u00f1ada para ser m\\u00e1s conversacional y entender mejor las solicitudes del usuario, marcando la entrada de Apple en asistentes de IA avanzadas.<\\/p>\\n<img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/images.unsplash.com\\/photo-1572686163547-e326c585bcc7?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w4OTkzMzh8MHwxfHJhbmRvbXx8fHx8fHx8fDE3ODE5Nzk0NTd8&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080\\\" alt=\\\"Una pantalla de tel\\u00e9fono mostrando la interfaz nueva de Siri AI con un patr\\u00f3n de ola colorida\\\">\\n<ul>\\n<li><b>Conversaci\\u00f3n m\\u00e1s natural<\\/b> permite que el asistente maneje chats bidireccionales. Puedes hacer una pregunta de seguimiento, y Siri AI recordar\\u00e1 el contexto de la interacci\\u00f3n anterior sin necesidad de que repitas informaci\\u00f3n.<\\/li>\\n<li><b>Conciencia de pantalla<\\/b> significa que Siri AI ahora puede entender lo que hay en tu pantalla. Puedes pedirle que resuma un art\\u00edculo que est\\u00e9s leyendo o agregar un producto de una p\\u00e1gina web a tu lista de compras solo transfiriendo tu voz.<\\/li>\\n<li><b>Contexto personal<\\/b> se utiliza para mejorar las respuestas. El sistema aprende tus h\\u00e1bitos, contactos importantes y rutinas para ofrecer sugerencias m\\u00e1s relevantes, como saber a qui\\u00e9n llamar si tienes dos \'Mam\\u00e1\' en tus contactos.<\\/li>\\n<li><b>Mejora en la integraci\\u00f3n de apps<\\/b> permite que Siri AI realice tareas complejas de varios pasos dentro y entre diferentes aplicaciones. Por ejemplo, puedes decirle que encuentre una foto de hace un mes, ed\\u00edtala y luego env\\u00edala a un amigo en un mensaje.<\\/li>\\n<li><b>Enfoque en privacidad<\\/b> garantiza que la mayor parte de este nuevo procesamiento ocurra directamente en tu dispositivo. Apple indica que para la mayor\\u00eda de las solicitudes comunes, tu informaci\\u00f3n personal no se env\\u00eda a la nube, protegiendo tus datos.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\nEl nuevo Siri AI es la respuesta directa de Apple a otros sistemas de IA avanzados y es una caracter\\u00edstica central de la actualizaci\\u00f3n de software iOS 27. La actualizaci\\u00f3n se espera que est\\u00e9 disponible para todas las dispositivos compatibles este oto\\u00f1o.\"}}','Apple has officially entered the advanced AI race by overhauling its voice assistant, now called \'Siri AI\', as part of the upcoming iOS 27. This new version promises a more natural, conversational experience, allowing Siri to understand context and handle complex, back-and-forth interactions without needing repeated information.',100,'passed','2026-06-20 22:17:38','2026-08-25 19:37:02',203,2,'Apple unveils \'Siri AI\' in the new iOS 27. Get a first look at the revamped assistant\'s advanced conversational skills and improved contextual understanding.','Apple, Siri AI, iOS 27, AI assistant, voice assistant, conversational AI, on-device AI, natural language processing',1,0,0,0,'uploads/pqV6TnqUBIL6p99c0mzf4TlbFqnyX52eOHVF6Pls_6a3b68b084fd7.webp',NULL,'[\"AI\\/ML\",\"iOS\",\"SiriKit\",\"Natural Language Processing\"]','[0.009906498,0.009906767,-0.01595885,0.0154048875,0.03517667,0.004697486,-0.020002073,-0.00028883896,0.009771933,-0.0476404,0.00081587